###  Why This Layer Exists — The Before & After

Remember Problem 2 from Chapter A1 — **Knowledge Silos**?

    WITHOUT KNOWLEDGE LAYER:
    ════════════════════════

    Alert: "ORA-01653 tablespace full on prod-db-01"

