      → Generic. No context. No history. Same answer every AI would give.


    WITH KNOWLEDGE LAYER:
    ═════════════════════

    Alert: "ORA-01653 tablespace full on prod-db-01"

    AI receives:
      • Alert metadata
      • Live SSH output
      • Live SQL results
      • Jira OPS-1234: "Same issue 6 months ago. Fixed by adding
        datafile + purging archive logs older than 7 days. Root cause
        was disabled archive log cleanup cron job after OS patching."
      • Confluence KB: "Oracle Tablespace Management SOP — Step 3:
        Always check archive log retention before extending."
