      purge archives + re-enable cron + add datafile as immediate relief.
      Note: autoextend is deliberately disabled per policy."
      Confidence: 94%
      
      → Context-aware. References YOUR history. Understands YOUR policies.

> **The Knowledge Layer is the difference between a tool that guesses and a tool that knows.**

