###  Cost Awareness

* From your RAG plan:*

    Embedding cost: ~$0.02 per 1 million tokens

    Example calculations:
      100 documents × 5,000 words each = 500,000 words ≈ 670,000 tokens
      Cost: 670,000 / 1,000,000 × $0.02 = $0.013

      1,000 documents = $0.13
      10,000 documents = $1.30
      
      Per search query: 1 embedding call ≈ $0.000002 (negligible)
      
      BOTTOM LINE: RAG is extremely cheap.
      Even 10,000 documents cost barely over $1 to embed.
      Periodic re-sync only re-embeds CHANGED documents (content hash skip).

